  ],
  "oracle_text": "Choose one —\n• Continue the Pilgrimage — Sacrifice a creature. If you do, draw a card, then you may put a creature card and/or a land card from your hand onto the battlefield.\n• Find Another Way — Return one or two target permanent cards from your graveyard to your hand."
